  "body": "Deadline Sale - Wednesday, 16th December 2026 at 4:00pm. (unless sold prior) \r\n\r\nImagine celebrating Christmas in this stunning, brand-new four-bedroom family home in the sought-after Strathmill, Orewa! \r\nDesigned for modern family living, this beautiful home features a stylish designer kitchen with quality benchtops and Fisher & Paykel appliances. Enjoy year-round comfort with central air conditioning, a built-in sound system and a generous decking \r\narea - perfect for relaxing, entertaining family and friends. \r\n\r\nUpstairs features four good-sized bedrooms, including a spacious master suite complete with its own ensuite. Designed with family living in mind, this level offers plenty of room for everyone to enjoy their own space. Bright, warm, and inviting, the \r\nhome also captures pleasant urban views, creating a relaxing setting where you can unwind and enjoy your private retreat. \r\n\r\nWith the newly opened road connecting Flavell Drive to Grand Drive, getting to the motorway, nearby shopping centres and everyday amenities is now even easier. \r\n\r\nThe deadline is set, and this property must be sold! Don't miss this fantastic opportunity to secure your brand-new family home in Orewa and be settled in time for Christmas. \r\n\r\nMake your move today - call NOW to arrange your viewing!\r\n\r\nTo view documentation relating to this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JAU4",
